ep_layer\") or hasattr(self, \"pair_rep_layer\") or hasattr(self, \"triples_score_layer\")\n        if has_relex:\n            target_span_rep, target_span_mask, entity_spans = self.select_span_target_embedding(\n                span_rep, scores, span_mask, labels, threshold, span_idx=span_idx\n            )\n        else:\n            target_span_rep, target_span_mask, entity_spans = None, None, None\n        return scores, target_span_rep, target_span_mask, entity_spans\n", "inference_source_sha256": "c08185a77d7d9eac5f7eed85f0997d8ae7122677b7c48e4260bca30baf39803d", "span_mode": "markerV0", "adapter": "trained encoder -> exact E3 endpoint projections -> all directed pairs -> trained relation head; NER selection bypassed"}
